"CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[1203201],"talks":[{"talkId":1203201,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["1203201","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":1203201,"initDialog":120320101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1036,1034],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/LQ/Shougun2_12032/Q1203201","priority":5,"questId":12032,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":120320101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":3029391042,"text":"Many challenges still lie ahead for Inazuma, but I am prepared for them.","nextNodeIds":[120320102,120320107,120320112,120320117,120320122,120320128]},{"nodeId":120320102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4002783882,"text":"About the \"challenges\"...","nextNodeIds":[120320103]},{"nodeId":120320103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":3220769498,"text":"Abolishing the Sakoku Decree has a myriad of implications. It would be folly to say that it will be all positive, and there will be no negative repercussions.","nextNodeIds":[120320104]},{"nodeId":120320104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":1274715930,"text":"For example, I can foresee the outside world posing a threat to Inazuma's businesses. These are the issues that I must work to solve.","nextNodeIds":[120320105]},{"nodeId":120320105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"Yae Miko","textMapHash":4041795282,"text":"Ei, you're thinking about this all so conscientiously. I've only got as far as wondering whether I'll be able to sell entrance tickets to the Grand Narukami Shrine in the future.","nextNodeIds":[120320106]},{"nodeId":120320106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":3622183618,"text":"Honestly, Miko...","nextNodeIds":[120320101]},{"nodeId":120320107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2482335586,"text":"About the gaze of the gods...","nextNodeIds":[120320108]},{"nodeId":120320108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":2091415914,"text":"Makoto's gaze was always fixed on the people of Inazuma. I always assumed it was because... that was her duty.","nextNodeIds":[120320109]},{"nodeId":120320109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":964167730,"text":"But now I see that hers was a gaze full of delight and hope. It was not just a duty, but a joy, too. She loved humanity very dearly.","nextNodeIds":[120320110]},{"nodeId":120320110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"Yae Miko","textMapHash":359902954,"text":"If people of the past deserved the gods' attention, then so do the people of the future.","nextNodeIds":[120320111]},{"nodeId":120320111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":962760098,"text":"Indeed. No longer will I ignore their passions and dreams.","nextNodeIds":[120320101]},{"nodeId":120320112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2859083954,"text":"About the centuries of dueling...","nextNodeIds":[120320113]},{"nodeId":120320113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":211919330,"text":"To put it bluntly, it was constant torture with no end in sight.","nextNodeIds":[120320114]},{"nodeId":120320114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":1760853666,"text":"Faced with an endless battle, I had to remain focused at all times. Had my concentration lapsed for but a moment, the Shogun's blade would have taken my life.","nextNodeIds":[120320115]},{"nodeId":120320115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":188872170,"text":"Safe to say, were it not for my previous experiences in combat, my skills would not have been up to the challenge. I would most certainly have been defeated.","nextNodeIds":[120320116]},{"nodeId":120320116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":3303389290,"text":"And through it all, you also had your part to play.","nextNodeIds":[120320101]},{"nodeId":120320117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":675191746,"text":"About the damage to the Sacred Sakura...","nextNodeIds":[120320118]},{"nodeId":120320118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":3706019914,"text":"Don't worry, I haven't forgotten. I will be sure to remind the Tenryou and Yashiro Commissions of their duties in this regard.","nextNodeIds":[120320119]},{"nodeId":120320119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":3896121210,"text":"It's not only the monsters that I am worried about. I'm concerned about what else might escape from the Sacred Sakura.","nextNodeIds":[120320120]},{"nodeId":120320120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"Yae Miko","textMapHash":845736394,"text":"That's a tough one, alright... There's plenty more besides memories held in the Ley Lines.","nextNodeIds":[120320121]},{"nodeId":120320121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":1792657330,"text":"Since you clearly understand, perhaps you could think about making an effort, too.","nextNodeIds":[120320101]},{"nodeId":120320122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3990755842,"text":"Yae Miko said she was placing her god—","nextNodeIds":[120320123]},{"nodeId":120320123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"Yae Miko","textMapHash":4167447194,"text":"Ahem! Yae Miko said nothing of the sort, and the Traveler has some nerve making up spurious claims about her while she is still present.","nextNodeIds":[120320124]},{"nodeId":120320124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"Yae Miko","textMapHash":3917380146,"text":"Some words are not to be passed on.","nextNodeIds":[120320125]},{"nodeId":120320125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"Yae Miko","textMapHash":1571321106,"text":"Trust me, you don't want to know the cost of betraying me. Just think of the things I said to you as our little secret. Understood?","nextNodeIds":[120320126]},{"nodeId":120320126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","textMapHash":1098946098,"text":"What are you talking about?","nextNodeIds":[120320127]},{"nodeId":120320127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"Yae Miko","textMapHash":629983346,"text":"Nothing. I suddenly want some fried tofu.","nextNodeIds":[120320101]},{"nodeId":120320128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2102008066,"text":"I have no other questions.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1203201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[3,60],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q1204209_N1036"},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1914201,2],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1914511,2],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[1203201],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"Raiden Shogun","count":